<title>DENMARK: Danish FLS share soars 4.7 percent.</title>
<headline>Danish FLS share soars 4.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish engineering and cement group FLS Industries shares soared 4.7 percent on Friday morning.</p>
<p>At 0930 GMT the share was 10 crowns up from the start of trading at 224 crowns. In the past two days the share has risen almost 10 percent.</p>
<p>Dealers said the rise was due to growing investor interest in engineering and cement industry paper and buying up of the share by a local broker.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
